A||||13||8Ball||MotorCity Online Beta||||1||
Z||000000||8Ball||07-08-2001||04:34 PM||||Well for the last two weeks I have been participateing in the Very early Beta stages of EA's newest raceing game MotorCity.<P>  MotorCity Online places you in the era of muscl cars in the heart of american iron. You can buy cars from the 30's to the 70's and then completely upgrade the engines. Put in differant engine blocks, pistons, carbs, valves, headers anyway you get the pic.<P>   Atm I am one of only 1500 ppl who are testing this game. My main problem with the game is the fact that right now the servers are only up 3 days for 5 hours a day. That is so they can do the repairs on the servers that are needed to achieve the stability they are looking for. Eventually it will be up 24/7.<P>  Another great point of this game is the fact you race against other live players, be it for cash or be it for pink slips. This is going to be an amazeing game!!!! I only wish It had a Fiero in it. I have a 675 hp 350 sbc in the game I would LOVE to stick in one  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Anyway just my 2 cents and thoughts on this great game!!!!<P>||||reg||1
Z||000001||Mach10||07-08-2001||06:00 PM||||How is the game, interface, graphics, and latency-wise? I'm thinking that this will be more of a contest of bandwidth, rather than muscle-car mods...<BR><p>[This message has been edited by Mach10 (edited 07-08-2001).]||||reg||7
Z||000002||8Ball||07-08-2001||06:07 PM||||Well the interface and graphics are comparable to porshe unleashed. The latentcy is pretty good atm all things considered. The servers are as of yet unstable and crashy but the lag is non existent atm.<BR>I think that by the time the beta is over it is going to be an amazeing game.<P>On a second note I almost had a guy here in town convinced to trade me his 86 gt for the beta cd  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> too bad he didn't go for it, cause I would have more than gladly given up my beta testing for fixing up a fiero  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000003||loafer87gt||07-08-2001||09:25 PM||||When did you receive your Beta CD? I was supposed to beta test the game as well but the game hasn't arrived yet. Are the interiors of the cars anymore detailed than in Porsche Unleashed? That was my only gripe against that game. Any chance you could post some screenies or have they a NDA agreement?||||reg||1
